ul.li:
Explain:
the differences between both types of parental benefits (rate, maximum entitlement weeks payable, etc.);
that the parents (if necessary) will receive the same type of parental benefits. Info

              Determine:


the number of standard or extended parental benefits requested by the client;

the number of standard or extended parental benefits requested by the child’s other parent, if necessary;

if the client is not entitled to the requested number of standard or extended parental weeks, whether the client wants to change the requested number of weeks;

if a RTW date is on file, whether there is a new one.
